  "summary": "Business Intelligence & Data Analytics Professional with over 25 years of experience designing enterprise reporting solutions, developing SQL-based applications, and transforming complex business data into actionable insights. Extensive experience delivering business intelligence, reporting, database development, and analytics solutions within highly regulated financial services and healthcare organizations.\n\nCurrent areas of focus include Amazon QuickSight (datasets, analyses, dashboards, Chat Agents, and applications), Amazon Redshift, PostgreSQL, SQL, Tableau, reporting modernization, and cloud-based analytics. Experienced in partnering with business stakeholders to design scalable reporting solutions, automate processes, improve data quality, and support data-driven decision making.\n\nIn addition to analytics and reporting, I bring over five years of experience in IT security, identity and access management (IAM), governance, SailPoint, SOC1 audit support, and security compliance. My unique combination of business intelligence, data analytics, governance, and technical leadership enables me to bridge the gap between business and technology while delivering practical, high-value solutions.\n\nCore Expertise:\nBusiness Intelligence & Data Analytics\nAmazon QuickSight & Amazon Redshift\nSQL, PostgreSQL & Data Modeling\nTableau & Enterprise Reporting\nDashboard Development & Data Visualization\nAWS Analytics\nReporting Modernization\nData Governance & IAM\nProcess Automation\nFinancial Services Technology",
